      "id": "q1",
      "type": "writing",
      "content": "<p><strong>Lid worden van de bibliotheek</strong></p><p>U wilt graag boeken lenen. U gaat naar de bibliotheek in uw woonplaats. U moet een formulier invullen.</p><p><em>Vul het formulier in.</em></p><p><em>Sommige gegevens mag u zelf verzinnen.</em></p><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; margin: 1rem 0;\"><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; background: #f5f5f5; font-weight: bold;\">Aanmeldformulier Bibliotheek Centrum</th></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; background: #e8e8e8; text-align: left;\">Persoonsgegevens</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Voor- en achternaam</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Geboortedatum</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Adres</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Postcode</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Woonplaats</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">Telefoonnummer</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\">E-mailadres</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; background: #e8e8e8; text-align: left;\">Wat wilt u het liefst lenen?</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\"></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\">&#9675; boeken &nbsp;&nbsp; &#9675; tijdschriften &nbsp;&nbsp; &#9675; dvd's</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; background: #e8e8e8; text-align: left;\">Hoe vaak komt u naar de bibliotheek?</th></tr><tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; font-weight: bold; width: 180px; background: #fafafa;\"></td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem;\">&#9675; 1x per week &nbsp;&nbsp; &#9675; 1x per maand &nbsp;&nbsp; &#9675; minder vaak</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; background: #e8e8e8; text-align: left;\">Waarom wilt u lid worden van de bibliotheek?</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.75rem; vertical-align: top; height: 80px;\"></td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.4rem 0.75rem; background: #e8e8e8; text-align: left;\">Welke boeken vindt u leuk om te lezen?</th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 0.75rem; vertical-align: top; height: 80px;\"></td></tr></table>",
